Snapshot Data feed contains data pertaining to trade quotations and other related information pertaining to the trading on Capital Market, Futures & Options, Currency Derivative and Wholesale Debt Market of National Stock Exchange of India Limited. This data is generated in binary format at a regular interval of 5, 2 or 1 minute. Snapshot Data is provided in binary file format over the internet and requires the use of an SFTP protocol to download these files. The tariff applicable for Snapshot/Delayed data is as under:
(*)The above mentioned snapshot/delayed commercials are per medium of data display i.e. website/App being two different mediums.
